		summary = "A **spruce** is a [[Tree|tree]] of the genus **Picea**, a genus of some 37 species of [[Conifer|coniferous]] [[Evergreen|evergreen]] trees in the family Pinaceae, found in the northern [[Temperate climate|temperate]] and boreal ([[Taiga|taiga]]) regions of the [[Northern Hemisphere]]. Picea is treated either in the [[Subfamily|subfamily]] Pinoideae, or the sole genus in its own subfamily **Piceoideae**.",
